msgid "Automatically log in:"
msgstr "Automatsko prijavljivanje:"

#: ui/main.qml:100
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:listbox, the following combobox selects the user to log in "
"automatically"
msgid "as user:"
msgstr "kao korisnik:"

#: ui/main.qml:150
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label:listbox, the following combobox selects the session that is started "
"automatically"
msgid "with session:"
msgstr "sa sesijom:"

#: ui/main.qml:180
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Auto-login does not support unlocking your KDE Wallet automatically, so it "
"will ask you to unlock it every time you log in.    <nl/><nl/>    To avoid "
"this, you can change the wallet to have a blank password. Note that this is "
"insecure and should only be done in a trusted environment."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko prijavljivanje ne podržava automatsko otključavanje K‑novčanika, "
"pa će tražiti da ga otključate pri svakom prijavljivanju.    <nl/><nl/>    "
"Da biste to izbegli, možete novčaniku postaviti praznu lozinku. Imajte na "
"umu da to nije bezbedno i da treba da se radi samo u pouzdanom okruženju."

#: ui/main.qml:185
#, kde-format
msgid "Open KDE Wallet Settings"
msgstr "Otvori postavke K‑novčanika"

#: ui/main.qml:192
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Log in again immediately after logging off"
msgstr "Ponovo se prijavi odmah posle odjavljivanja"

